      "id": 3514926,
      "postDate": "2026-08-20T12:25:37.590Z",
      "rawMarkdown": "Here's the only cell you need from several dozen top-scoring public notebooks:\n\n**[DINOv3 architecture](https://www.kaggle.com/code/mattiaangeli/bend-the-knee-to-dinov3-ensembled?scriptVersionId=343218600&cellId=24)**\n\nIt was only a modest addition to [Pilkwang's 20-model DINOv2 ensemble](https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/pilkwang/rsna-knee-weights), since their errors remain fairly correlated.\n",
      "content": "<p>Here's the only cell you need from several dozen top-scoring public notebooks:</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/code/mattiaangeli/bend-the-knee-to-dinov3-ensembled?scriptVersionId=343218600&amp;cellId=24\" target=\"_blank\">DINOv3 architecture</a></strong></p>\n<p>It was only a modest addition to <a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/pilkwang/rsna-knee-weights\" target=\"_blank\">Pilkwang's 20-model DINOv2 ensemble</a>, since their errors remain fairly correlated.</p>",
